    "plainEnglish": "This code describes pain that a patient is experiencing specifically in their right knee. The pain could result from various causes such as arthritis, injury, overuse, inflammation, or other joint problems, and may range from mild discomfort to severe pain that limits movement. Patients typically report aching, throbbing, or sharp sensations in the knee area that may worsen with activity or certain positions.",
